  "label": "Social Stigma",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the concept of social stigma — the negative attitudes and beliefs that lead to discrimination against individuals or groups perceived as 'different' or 'unacceptable'. The text suggests that being 'disgusting' leads to social rejection, and the meme uses the wild boar to represent those who are stigmatized.",
